{
  "outcome": "revise",
  "gaps": [
    "RUL B lower bound of 3 cycles is not evidenced: EV-PRG-02 reports RUL B point estimate 10 cycles with lower 3 and upper 15, but the evidence does not show the derivation or confidence interval for the lower bound of 3 cycles. The planning lower bound calculation in EV-MNT-04 and EV-MNT-09 uses min(A 10th percentile 20, B lower 3) = 3 cycles, yet the source of the B lower value is not documented in the cited evidence items.",
    "Part shortage rationale for engine swap not fully substantiated: The brief claims the removed engine waits for parts (TF-FAN-2101) while the lease engine is swapped in. However, EV-MNT-01 and EV-MNT-06 show FM-FAN-03 (severe on-wing replace) lists TF-FAN-2101 as short, while FM-FAN-04 (engine_change) has no parts-short annotation. EV-MNT-03 and EV-MNT-08 show TF-FAN-2101 has 0 available (75-day lead) but TF-FAN-2103 has 2 available (28-day lead). No evidence establishes that fan_degradation repair definitively requires the unavailable TF-FAN-2101 rather than the available TF-FAN-2103, leaving the engine-swap-plus-parts-wait rationale unsubstantiated versus a 28-day on-wing repair under FM-FAN-03.",
    "Mandatory document actions missing from plan: EV-MNT-07 lists mandatory document actions for fan_degradation: AMM-TF-R3 71-00-00→FM-HPC-06, AMM-TF-R3 72-21-00→FM-FAN-01, SB-TF-72-0157 3.B→FM-FAN-01. The plan uses FM-FAN-04 and FM-FAN-03 but does not include FM-FAN-01 (inspect) or FM-HPC-06, which are linked to mandatory documents. Per precedence rules, mandatory document actions stay in the plan even next to an engine swap; their absence is a gap."
  ],
  "challenges": [
    {"kind": "unsupported_number", "claim": 6, "value": 3, "detail": "Planning lower bound of 3 cycles cites EV-PRG-01 and EV-PRG-02, but EV-PRG-02 only states 'lower 3' without showing derivation or confidence interval for the RUL B lower bound."},
    {"kind": "part_not_in_evidence", "claim": 8, "value": null, "detail": "TF-FAN-2101 is cited as short for FM-FAN-03 in EV-MNT-01 and EV-MNT-06, but the plan uses FM-FAN-04 (engine_change) which has no parts-short annotation in the evidence; the parts list for FM-FAN-04 is not shown."},
    {"kind": "missing_mandate", "claim": 15, "value": null, "detail": "Mandatory document actions AMM-TF-R3 72-21-00→FM-FAN-01 and SB-TF-72-0157 3.B→FM-FAN-01 are listed in EV-MNT-07 but FM-FAN-01 is not included in the plan (claims 10, 11, 14)."}
  ]
}

